panish Civil War are unearthed as a woman searches for the remains of her grandfather's father and discovers the story of an idealistic young teacher from Tarragona.","tagline":"Based on the true story of Antoni Benaiges."},{"language":"es-ES","title":"El maestro que prometió el mar","overview":"Ariadna descubre que su abuelo busca desde hace tiempo los restos de su padre, desaparecido en la Guerra Civil. Decidida a ayudarlo, viaja a Burgos, donde están exhumando una fosa común en la que podría estar enterrado. Durante su estancia allí, conocerá la historia de Antoni Benaiges, un joven maestro de Tarragona que antes de la guerra fue profesor de su abuelo. Mediante un innovador método pedagógico Antoni inspiró a sus alumnos y les hizo una promesa: llevarlos a ver el mar.","tagline":"Basada en la historia real de Antoni Benaiges."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7uLVwIRpZ9dJwZ4tz4mGBZncWmR.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7uLVwIRpZ9dJwZ4tz4mGBZncWmR.png","language":"en","width":2267,"height":660},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fWUUdTc03yKDPgD8XOjcOjldz1x.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fWUUdTc03yKDPgD8XOjcOjldz1x.png","language":"en","width":3331,"height":1280},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/efZJn6ODs5LCgbgVWnJ399Y83no.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/efZJn6ODs5LCgbgVWnJ399Y83no.png","language":"es","width":400,"height":165}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dybac6MmIId9S6wdLUGj23JzeN7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dybac6MmIId9S6wdLUGj23JzeN7.jpg","language":"it","width":948,"height":1422},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPc3cUblFw527YslR5ISAfQ3xSN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sPc3cUblFw527YslR5ISAfQ3xSN.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origi